n⚠️ Join our community to trade more! Only trade using the in-game trade system.","path":"/game/138384544898173-trade-a-brainrot","slug":"138384544898173-trade-a-brainrot","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/132047dae39ea6a3758167362e1aed80a2ce261402a00471ab3a8014f489efc7.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8c91f77d7f5a47a5573b598819636cbd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":42,"visitor":173157102,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-12-18T05:16:32.586Z","creator":{"name":"I make brainrot games","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":9,"freeCount":8,"keyCount":4,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":138365924124161,"name":"Backrooms Drift [🛟]","desc":"[FULL RELEASE] V1\n\nDrift and drive through the endless Backrooms! 🚗\nEarn Drift Points from smooth slides or collect points scattered across the map. 💨\n\nCreate your very own custom maps that other users can explore & drift around in. 🗺️\n\nPurchase new cars with unique speeds and sounds from the shop! 🏎️\nTandem drift with others or explore the Backrooms solo! 🌀\n\nexpect bugs and problems, if so report them via my group tagged down below ⚠\n\n-- CONTROLS --\nW, A, S, D - Movement\nLCtrl / □ / B  - Handbrake\nShift + P - Freecam\nF / △ / Y - First Person\n\nCredits;\nDeveloper - @lewisShortNose\nContributors - @MarkTheMaki\nModelers - @lewisShortNose & @DinoTubeGamin\nInspiration - Mall Drifters/@lolusercold","path":"/game/138365924124161-backrooms-drift","slug":"138365924124161-backrooms-drift","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9ab6a3315183004c4a5277d7ee469acb379e1c71e213bbff0172381fb146c2fc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-82d8259c924f97429e6c088326eae7dd/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":42,"visitor":36754566,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-27T08:05:16.081Z","creator":{"name":"lewisShortNose","type":"User"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":17382280326,"name":"The Robloxia: Until Dawn","desc":"THIS GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS\n\nWelcome to The Robloxia: Until Dawn, a game that tries to turn popular classic roblox myths and etc. all together into a survival game, team up with with 5 more survivors against different killers and try to escape their grip, or play as them and eliminate everyone on sight before the portal spawns.\n\nTook concepts, soundtracks and inspiration from:\n- Sonic.EXE: The Disaster (RIP)\n- Sonic.EXE: Spectral Fades\n- Left4Dead2\n- Mob of the dead\n\nSome soundtracks are used without permission as said composers were quite hard to contact, if you own a soundtrack that is used in the game and can prove that it is made by you then please join our community server and contact me there, it will be replaced if needed. All credits are in the game.\n\nI do not own any licenses of any un-official/original soundtracks used in the game, nor any rights to anything else. This is just a passion project for fun\n\nOriginally made on February 10th 2023","path":"/game/17382280326-the-robloxia-until-dawn","slug":"17382280326-the-robloxia-until-dawn","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/7df606d5aabb9d4b6c22dbe35f8b89a51ca3542ef15fbc9041c7e332e11f81fb.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-04485429bc1df9254162cc3197c9e8e1/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":42,"visitor":21619467,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-02-24T02:28:06.161Z","creator":{"name":"The Robloxia: Until Dawn community","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":20,"freeCount":17,"keyCount":4,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":115938967059830,"name":"[DIGITAL UTOPIA] Find the Burgers!","desc":"Welcome to Find the Burgers! This Game Currently Has 98 Burgers to Find!\n\nShoutout to everyone that helped make the game!\nEnjoy, and happy hunting!\n\nThank you ccman1122 for the Icon!","path":"/game/115938967059830-find-the-burgers","slug":"115938967059830-find-the-burgers","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/765e018d8232808dbb18949dd9ed7bef59a88f0030252faa2b66f6be11d08adc.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6dd37